    "created_at": "2023-02-13T16:51:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-13T16:51:52Z",
    "body": "I guess you're right that they'll automatically disappear anyway. I don't have a lot of experience with weak references so I don't know if clearing them proactively like that is bad/who cares/good.\r\n\r\nThere's also #713 (and #720) about the global list of `MutationObserver` objects being wrong. https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/713#issuecomment-443606097 still seems like the correct solution for that.\r\n\r\nI'll try to create a PR for this and then get everyone involved to date to review.",
